# English twin of roulette.nme: the full Luna Casino roulette simulator
# in English sentence syntax. Same structure and messages as the Korean
# original: name ask, capital choice, five bet types with validation
# loops, jackpot, streaks, settlement, and restart.
# Sentence spellings with minimal Python expressions: show ask set while if
# end plus the random adapter and str()/int() conversions for formatting.
# Run: nme r roulette.en.nme
use random

set name to Guest
set playing to 1
set inGame to 1
set credits to 500
set startCredits to 500
set topCredits to 500
set topJackpot to 0
set totalSpins to 0
set winCount to 0
set lossCount to 0
set winStreak to 0
set lossStreak to 0
set betType to 0
set betMode to 0
set targetType to 0
set betAmount to 0
set betNumber to 0
set betColor to red
set betParity to odd
set betZone to small
set betColumn to first
set multiplier to 2
set won to 0
set jackpot to 0
set winnings to 0
set ballNumber to 0
set ballColor to green
set ballParity to zero
set ballZone to zero
set ballColumn to zero
set parityTest to 0
set multiplierCount to 1
set balanceCheck to 0
set columnTest to 0

while playing
set inGame to 1
set totalSpins to 0
set winCount to 0
set lossCount to 0
set winStreak to 0
set lossStreak to 0
set topJackpot to 0
repeat 3 times and show Welcome to Luna Casino!
show In the dark night, this is the hottest place under the moonlight
ask name What is your name?
show Hello, name! Today the wheel of fortune awaits you
show Choose your starting capital 1 is humble 100 2 is generous 500 3 is reckless 1000
ask number startChoice Which one do you start with?
if startChoice equals 1
set credits to 100
end
if startChoice equals 3
set credits to 1000
end
if startChoice equals 2
set credits to 500
end
if startChoice is greater than 1
if startChoice is less than 3
set credits to 500
end
end
if startChoice is greater than 3 then set credits to 500
if startChoice is less than 1 then set credits to 500
set startCredits to credits
set topCredits to credits
while inGame
show "Your balance is " + str(credits) + " credits"
show "Today's record is " + str(totalSpins) + " spins"
show "You have won " + str(winCount) + " rounds and lost " + str(lossCount) + " rounds"
show 1. Spin the roulette
show 2. Listen to the betting methods
show 3. View my record
show 4. Leave the casino
ask number menuChoice What would you like to do?
if menuChoice equals 1
if credits is less than 1
show Your balance is gone... the casino offers you a free drink
set inGame to 0
end
if credits is greater than 0
show Choose your bet type
show 1. Number bet: 0 to 36, pays 35x
show 2. Color bet: red or black, pays 1x
show 3. Odd or even bet, pays 1x
show 4. Size bet: small 1 to 18, big 19 to 36, pays 1x
show 5. Column bet: first 1 to 12, second 13 to 24, third 25 to 36, pays 2x
set betTypeDone to 0
while betTypeDone is less than 1
ask number betType, "What will you bet on: "
if betType is less than 5
if betType is greater than 1
set betTypeDone to 1
set betMode to betType
end
end
if betType equals 5
set betTypeDone to 1
set betMode to 5
end
if betType equals 1
set betTypeDone to 1
set betMode to 1
end
if betTypeDone is less than 1
show Please enter a number from 1 to 5 again
end
end
if betMode equals 1
set betNumberDone to 0
while betNumberDone is less than 1
ask number betNumber, "Choose one number from 0 to 36: "
if betNumber is less than 36
if betNumber is greater than 0
set betNumberDone to 1
end
end
if betNumber equals 36
set betNumberDone to 1
end
if betNumber equals 0
set betNumberDone to 1
end
if betNumberDone is less than 1
show Only numbers from 0 to 36 can be bet
end
end
set multiplier to 36
set targetType to 1
end
if betMode equals 2
set betColorDone to 0
while betColorDone is less than 1
ask number betColorChoice, "Red is 1, black is 2 "
if betColorChoice equals 1
set betColorDone to 1
set betColor to red
end
if betColorChoice equals 2
set betColorDone to 1
set betColor to black
end
if betColorDone is less than 1
show 1 is red, 2 is black. Please enter it again
end
end
set multiplier to 2
set targetType to 2
end
if betMode equals 3
set betParityDone to 0
while betParityDone is less than 1
ask number betParityChoice, "Odd is 1, even is 2 "
if betParityChoice equals 1
set betParityDone to 1
set betParity to odd
end
if betParityChoice equals 2
set betParityDone to 1
set betParity to even
end
if betParityDone is less than 1
show 1 is odd, 2 is even. Please enter it again
end
end
set multiplier to 2
set targetType to 3
end
if betMode equals 4
set betZoneDone to 0
while betZoneDone is less than 1
ask number betZoneChoice, "Small numbers 1 to 18 are 1, big numbers 19 to 36 are 2 "
if betZoneChoice equals 1
set betZoneDone to 1
set betZone to small
end
if betZoneChoice equals 2
set betZoneDone to 1
set betZone to big
end
if betZoneDone is less than 1
show 1 is small, 2 is big. Please enter it again
end
end
set multiplier to 2
set targetType to 4
end
if betMode equals 5
set betColumnDone to 0
while betColumnDone is less than 1
ask number betColumnChoice, "First column is 1, second is 2, third is 3 "
if betColumnChoice equals 1
set betColumnDone to 1
set betColumn to first
end
if betColumnChoice equals 2
set betColumnDone to 1
set betColumn to second
end
if betColumnChoice equals 3
set betColumnDone to 1
set betColumn to third
end
if betColumnDone is less than 1
show 1 is the first column, 2 the second, 3 the third
end
end
set multiplier to 3
set targetType to 5
end
set betAmountDone to 0
while betAmountDone is less than 1
ask number betAmount, "How much will you bet: "
set balanceCheck to credits
subtract betAmount from balanceCheck
if balanceCheck is less than 0
show The bet is more than your balance. Please enter it again
end
if balanceCheck equals 0
set betAmountDone to 1
end
if balanceCheck is greater than 0
if betAmount is greater than 0
set betAmountDone to 1
end
end
if betAmountDone is less than 1
show The bet must be at least 1 credit
end
end
show The dealer spins the roulette with power!
repeat 3 times and show The ball is sliding under the casino lights
repeat 2 times and show "Ta-da-da-da"
set ballNumber to random number from 0 to 36
show The ball is stopping and the wheel of fate slowly slows down
set ballColor to green
if ballNumber equals 1 then set ballColor to red
if ballNumber equals 2 then set ballColor to black
if ballNumber equals 3 then set ballColor to red
if ballNumber equals 4 then set ballColor to black
if ballNumber equals 5 then set ballColor to red
if ballNumber equals 6 then set ballColor to black
if ballNumber equals 7 then set ballColor to red
if ballNumber equals 8 then set ballColor to black
if ballNumber equals 9 then set ballColor to red
if ballNumber equals 10 then set ballColor to black
if ballNumber equals 11 then set ballColor to black
if ballNumber equals 12 then set ballColor to red
if ballNumber equals 13 then set ballColor to black
if ballNumber equals 14 then set ballColor to red
if ballNumber equals 15 then set ballColor to black
if ballNumber equals 16 then set ballColor to red
if ballNumber equals 17 then set ballColor to black
if ballNumber equals 18 then set ballColor to red
if ballNumber equals 19 then set ballColor to red
if ballNumber equals 20 then set ballColor to black
if ballNumber equals 21 then set ballColor to red
if ballNumber equals 22 then set ballColor to black
if ballNumber equals 23 then set ballColor to red
if ballNumber equals 24 then set ballColor to black
if ballNumber equals 25 then set ballColor to red
if ballNumber equals 26 then set ballColor to black
if ballNumber equals 27 then set ballColor to red
if ballNumber equals 28 then set ballColor to black
if ballNumber equals 29 then set ballColor to black
if ballNumber equals 30 then set ballColor to red
if ballNumber equals 31 then set ballColor to black
if ballNumber equals 32 then set ballColor to red
if ballNumber equals 33 then set ballColor to black
if ballNumber equals 34 then set ballColor to red
if ballNumber equals 35 then set ballColor to black
if ballNumber equals 36 then set ballColor to red
set ballParity to zero
set parityTest to ballNumber
if parityTest is greater than 0
while parityTest is greater than 1
subtract 2 from parityTest
end
if parityTest equals 1
set ballParity to odd
end
if parityTest equals 0
set ballParity to even
end
end
set ballZone to big
if ballNumber is less than 19
if ballNumber is greater than 1
set ballZone to small
end
end
if ballNumber is less than 1
set ballZone to zero
end
set ballColumn to zero
set columnTest to ballNumber
if columnTest is greater than 1
if columnTest is less than 13
set ballColumn to first
end
end
if columnTest equals 1
set ballColumn to first
end
if columnTest is greater than 13
if columnTest is less than 25
set ballColumn to second
end
end
if columnTest equals 13
set ballColumn to second
end
if columnTest is greater than 25
if columnTest is less than 37
set ballColumn to third
end
end
if columnTest equals 25
set ballColumn to third
end
show The ball has stopped!
show "The winning number is " + str(ballNumber) + "!"
show "The color of the ball is " + ballColor
show "Your bet was " + str(betAmount) + " credits"
if ballZone equals zero
show Zero! The house smiles. All bets go to the casino
end
set won to 0
set jackpot to 0
if targetType equals 1
if ballNumber equals betNumber
set won to 1
set jackpot to 1
end
end
if targetType equals 2
if ballColor equals betColor
set won to 1
end
end
if targetType equals 3
if ballParity equals betParity
set won to 1
end
end
if targetType equals 4
if ballZone equals betZone
set won to 1
end
end
if targetType equals 5
if ballColumn equals betColumn
set won to 1
end
end
set winnings to betAmount
set multiplierCount to 1
while multiplierCount is less than multiplier
add betAmount to winnings
add 1 to multiplierCount
end
subtract betAmount from credits
add 1 to totalSpins
if won equals 1
add winnings to credits
add 1 to winCount
add 1 to winStreak
set lossStreak to 0
show "You won! The winnings are " + str(winnings) + " credits"
end
if won equals 0
add 1 to lossCount
add 1 to lossStreak
set winStreak to 0
show Too bad, this round goes to the house
end
if jackpot equals 1
show Jackpot! Jackpot! Jackpot!
repeat 2 times and show The vault of fate opens at Luna Casino
show The miracle of 35x odds! The top jackpot record is renewed
set topJackpot to winnings
end
if winStreak equals 2
show The streak continues! The dealer is getting nervous
end
if winStreak equals 3
show "3 win streak! Today " + name + " is invincible"
end
if lossStreak equals 3
show 3 losses in a row... Do not fall for the house tricks. Bet coolly
end
if lossStreak equals 4
show 4 losses in a row... Take a break if you like. The casino will be here tomorrow
end
if credits is greater than topCredits
set topCredits to credits
end
show "Your balance is " + str(credits) + " credits"
end
end
if menuChoice equals 2
show Let me explain the betting methods
show 1. Number bet: choose one number from 0 to 36
show If you hit it, a huge reward of 35x awaits you
show 2. Color bet: guess whether the ball lands on red or black
show 3. Odd or even bet: guess whether the winning number is odd or even
show Zero is neither odd nor even, so the house takes it
show 4. Size bet: small numbers 1 to 18 or big numbers 19 to 36
show 5. Column bet: guess which of the three columns comes out
show Odds: number 35x, color odd-even and size 1x, column 2x
show If zero comes out, all bets go to the casino
end
if menuChoice equals 3
show "Today's record for " + name
show "Total bets: " + str(totalSpins)
show "Rounds won: " + str(winCount)
show "Rounds lost: " + str(lossCount)
show "Top jackpot: " + str(topJackpot) + " credits"
show "Top balance: " + str(topCredits) + " credits"
end
if menuChoice equals 4
show On the way out of the casino... the dealer says goodbye
set inGame to 0
end
if menuChoice is less than 1
show Invalid choice. Please enter a number from 1 to 4
end
if menuChoice is greater than 4
show Invalid choice. Please enter a number from 1 to 4
end
end
show The casino closes its doors for today
show name + ", here is your settlement for today"
if credits is greater than startCredits
show "Big win! You beat the casino today and finish with " + str(credits) + " credits"
end
if credits is less than startCredits
show The house wins today, but we hope you had a good time
end
if credits equals startCredits
show Break-even game. Even bigger luck awaits you next time
end
show "The top jackpot record is " + str(topJackpot) + " credits"
ask number retry Do you want to try again 1 is restart 2 is quit
if retry equals 2
set playing to 0
end
if retry equals 1
set playing to 1
end
end
repeat 3 times and show Goodbye, name!
show Luna Casino always awaits your return
